{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;SLEEP TERROR&quot;  is an adventure-exploration horror game in which you travel through your nightmares and dreams. Travel through various places, explore and use the tools and items found on the board to make your escape easier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632450/extras/8e7dd0b4a5c69a06c090415013ab3ef1.poster.avif?t=1756541906\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632450/extras/8e7dd0b4a5c69a06c090415013ab3ef1.webm?t=1756541906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632450/extras/8e7dd0b4a5c69a06c090415013ab3ef1.mp4?t=1756541906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a demo of Sleep Terror. The demo includes: the first two levels of the game, one boss enemy, access to basic mechanics, approximately 20-30 minutes of gameplay. This demo aims to showcase the game's basic mechanics and atmosphere. The full version will include significantly more levels, enemies, and a complete storyline.<br><br><br><br>&quot;SLEEP TERROR&quot; is an adventure-exploration horror game in which you travel through your nightmares and dreams. Travel through various places, explore and use the tools and items found on the board to make your escape easier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >alt + enter for fullscreen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632450/extras/19d0fe3758ad31896ce4fd13055d1541.poster.avif?t=1756541906\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/